    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dive into the silliest, speediest, most <i>educational</i> snail race on the planet! \ud83d\udc0c\ud83c\udfc1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snail Race\u00a0</strong>combines colorful fun with smart learning, helping kids develop essential skills \u2014 all while laughing and racing with their favorite quirky snails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s counting, reading, solving puzzles, or boosting general knowledge, each correct answer powers up your snail for a turbo-charged dash to the finish line! The better you do, the faster you go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s learning made fun, with no pressure \u2014 just joyful discovery and lots of smiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>\u2705 A unique mix of racing and learning for kids<br>\u2705 Covers basic skills: counting, reading, logic, and general knowledge<br>\u2705 Answer questions to speed up your snail \u2014 the fastest wins!<br>\u2705 Colorful cartoon graphics and adorable, funny snail characters<br>\u2705 Lighthearted, positive pacing that keeps kids engaged<br>\u2705 Designed for ages 5+ \u2014 safe and easy to play<br>\u2705 Perfect for home or classroom use</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How it works:</strong><br>1\ufe0f\u20e3 Kids race their chosen snail<br>2\ufe0f\u20e3 They answer fun questions during the race<br>3\ufe0f\u20e3 Every correct answer makes their snail go faster!<br>4\ufe0f\u20e3 Cross the finish line first for the win \u2014 and keep learning round after round!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snail Race turns learning into an exciting race where knowledge is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for?<br>Pick your snail \u2014 and let\u2019s race to learn! \ud83d\udc0c\ud83d\udca8\ud83c\udf89</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dive into the silliest, speediest, most <i>educational</i> snail race on the planet! \ud83d\udc0c\ud83c\udfc1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snail Race\u00a0</strong>combines colorful fun with smart learning, helping kids develop essential skills \u2014 all while laughing and racing with their favorite quirky snails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s counting, reading, solving puzzles, or boosting general knowledge, each correct answer powers up your snail for a turbo-charged dash to the finish line! The better you do, the faster you go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s learning made fun, with no pressure \u2014 just joyful discovery and lots of smiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>\u2705 A unique mix of racing and learning for kids<br>\u2705 Covers basic skills: counting, reading, logic, and general knowledge<br>\u2705 Answer questions to speed up your snail \u2014 the fastest wins!<br>\u2705 Colorful cartoon graphics and adorable, funny snail characters<br>\u2705 Lighthearted, positive pacing that keeps kids engaged<br>\u2705 Designed for ages 5+ \u2014 safe and easy to play<br>\u2705 Perfect for home or classroom use</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How it works:</strong><br>1\ufe0f\u20e3 Kids race their chosen snail<br>2\ufe0f\u20e3 They answer fun questions during the race<br>3\ufe0f\u20e3 Every correct answer makes their snail go faster!<br>4\ufe0f\u20e3 Cross the finish line first for the win \u2014 and keep learning round after round!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snail Race turns learning into an exciting race where knowledge is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for?<br>Pick your snail \u2014 and let\u2019s race to learn! \ud83d\udc0c\ud83d\udca8\ud83c\udf89</p>",
